# Architecture (currency-radar-by)

MVP: NBRB official USD + best «Сдать» USD + diff. Static site for GitHub Pages (no proxy). Minimal styles. No tests.

## Layers

- `App` / UI — display only; no Myfin/HTML knowledge
- `useRates` — orchestrates NBRB + `BestUsdSellRateProvider`, computes diff
- `api/nbrb.ts` — NBRB fetch
- `providers/*` — best sell-rate abstraction and implementations
- `lib/dayCache.ts` — cache until end of local calendar day

## Best rate abstraction

UI and hooks depend only on:

```typescript
interface BestUsdSellRate {
  readonly rate: number;
  readonly asOf: Date;
  readonly sourceLabel: string;
}

interface BestUsdSellRateProvider {
  fetchBestUsdSellRate(): Promise<BestUsdSellRate>;
}
```

- Current implementation: `MyfinBestUsdSellRateProvider` (HTML parse)
- Active wiring in `src/providers/index.ts` only — swap provider in one place
- Day-cache wraps the provider (or factory), so a future API provider is cached without UI changes

## Data

- NBRB: `GET https://api.nbrb.by/exrates/rates/431` → `Cur_OfficialRate`, `Date`
- Myfin: `GET https://myfin.by/currency/minsk` → «Лучшие курсы» → USD → **Сдать**
- Diff: `best.rate - nbrbOfficial`, always with sign, 4 decimal places

## UI / errors

- Loading: «Загрузка…»
- One source failed — show the other + error
- Both ok — three lines; best-rate line includes `sourceLabel`

## Out of scope (do not add unless asked)

- Fancy styles, tests, «Купить», bank lists, history, push notifications
- Backend / Vite proxy — browser `fetch` only
- Second best-rate provider beyond the interface + Myfin

## Deploy

- Vite `base: '/currency-radar-by/'` for GitHub Pages
